-- Arena challenges batch 4/14: rows 076-100 (track: Datasheet Intelligence, category: ECE)

T_J = T_A + P_D × θ_JA','{"choices": ["75°C", "27°C", "100°C", "125°C"], "correct": 3}'::jsonb,'T_J = 25 + 2 × 50 = 25 + 100 = 125°C. If T_J(max) = 150°C, the device is at the edge. Derating power dissipation or adding heatsink (lower θ_JC + θ_CS) is necessary for reliability.','{multiple_choice}'::text[],0.76) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;

R_min = t_r / (0.8473 × C_b)','{"choices": ["3.3 kΩ", "1 kΩ", "10 kΩ", "3.54 kΩ"], "correct": 3}'::jsonb,'R_min = 300×10⁻⁹ / (0.8473 × 100×10⁻¹²) = 300×10⁻⁹ / 84.73×10⁻¹² = 3.54 kΩ. Also check maximum pull-up resistance (R_max = (VCC − V_OL)/I_OL) for sink current capability.','{multiple_choice}'::text[],0.62) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;

P_D(T) = P_D(25°C) − (T_A − 25) × derating','{"choices": ["2 W", "0.04 W", "1.04 W", "1.36 W"], "correct": 2}'::jsonb,'P_D(85°C) = 2 − (85 − 25) × 0.016 = 2 − 60 × 0.016 = 2 − 0.96 = 1.04 W. Derating curves are mandatory reading for automotive and industrial applications operating at elevated temperatures.','{multiple_choice}'::text[],0.58) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;

C_L = (C1 × C2)/(C1 + C2) + C_stray; assume C1 = C2.','{"choices": ["C1 = C2 = 18 pF", "C1 = C2 = 30 pF", "C1 = C2 = 9 pF", "C1 = C2 = 15 pF"], "correct": 1}'::jsonb,'(C1/2) + C_stray = C_L → C1/2 = 18 − 3 = 15 pF → C1 = 30 pF. Mismatched C_L pulls the crystal frequency outside spec. This is a common datasheet oversight in board design.','{multiple_choice}'::text[],0.5) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;

V_noise_rms = e_n × √BW','{"choices": ["500 nV", "1.58 µV", "5 µV", "50 nV"], "correct": 1}'::jsonb,'V_noise_rms = 5×10⁻⁹ × √(100×10³) = 5×10⁻⁹ × 316.2 = 1581 nV ≈ 1.58 µV RMS. For 24-bit audio (dynamic range ~144 dB), noise must be < 1 µV over 20 kHz — requiring e_n < 7 nV/√Hz.','{multiple_choice}'::text[],0.55) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;
